# load-cv610-online loads the MPP modules and refuses to start after
# load_hisilicon has; without it the stock S70vendor loads nothing. Removed
# here, from the final tree, since a package hook only reaches its own
# per-package copy.
/usr/bin/load_hisilicon
# The encoder opens its own IMX662 plugin (/usr/lib/cv610) and the image's
# IMX335 one; the other sensor plugins and the streamer profiles under
# /etc/sensors have no reader here.
